'''Spitting scarabs''' are a monster that is summoned by [[Kephri]] in the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. They use ranged attacks that can inflict [[poison]] starting at 6 damage. Like the [[arcane scarab]], the spitting scarab's attacks can hit through protection prayers.

